pub fn register_graph(name: String, arc: Arc<RwLock<ThreadedGraph>>) {
    let displaced = GRAPH_REGISTRY.lock().insert(name, arc);   // <-- name only, no db index
    debug_assert!(
        displaced.is_none(),
        "register_graph: name already registered; missing graph_free or placeholder swap"
    );
    if let Some(displaced) = displaced {
        std::thread::spawn(move || drop(displaced));
    }
}
```

The comment above the assert says the invariant is maintained by `graph_free` and the placeholder swap. Both are keyed to a single keyspace; neither accounts for the same name existing in a different database.

