**Untracked files in a checkout are not detected as local changes.**

`git diff HEAD` does not report untracked files. GraphBLAS's cmake globs `PreJIT/*.c`, so an untracked kernel in `deps/GraphBLAS/PreJIT` gets compiled into `libgraphblas.a`. An untracked source file in a globbed RediSearch directory has the same effect. In both cases `local_changes` returns `None`. The artifact is then published under the pinned key and served to every worktree on that pin. That is the cross-worktree contamination this module exists to prevent.

Add the untracked file list, without ignored files, to both the check and the fingerprint.

